      },
      "note": [
        "To prevent disclosure of information, random rounding off was applied in the table.  Cell values 1 and 2 have been rounded off to either 0 or 3 with predetermined probabilities. This is why the study domains sometimes do not add up to the total.",
        "One person is counted once for each study programme and can thus be included in statistics twice for the same year.",
        "Field of education MYH refers to the classification of programmes in the fields of education used by the Swedish National Agency for Higher Vocational Education (MYH). The fields of education are based on the SUN 2020 classification.",
        "The admitted student´s upper secondary education refers to the orientation of the upper completed secondary school programme. Data for the latest reference year are reported in June.",
        "Refers to the admitted student´s highest level of education completed up to and including the spring term of the relevant year. Data for the latest reference year are reported in June.",
        "The statistics include students on higher vocational education (HVE) courses. HVE courses are shorter HVE courses and can be one or more courses (course packages) that together amount to a maximum of 99 HVE credits.",
        "The number of admitted students refers to persons who have been students including those who have been added during the course of the education and those who have dropped out of the education."
      ],
